OL,3,GNEWSAPeanut allergy scare inspired
OL,4,Alife-saving idea
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs a child, Zak Marks had a severe
OL,7,Fallergic reaction after eating toast
OL,8,Fthat contained traces of peanut butter.
OL,10,FHe wrote a note in his phone to
OL,11,F"redesign the adrenaline pen" after he
OL,12,Ffound carrying the medication
OL,13,F"cumbersome" and it "expired quickly".
OL,15,FHe developed the idea during his final
OL,16,Fyear studying industrial design at
OL,17,FLoughborough University, creating a
OL,18,Fwall-mounted anaphylaxis kit equipped
OL,19,Fwith emergency adrenaline pens.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
