OL,3,GNEWSAPeanut allergy scare inspired
OL,4,Alife-saving idea
OL,5,
OL,6,FSince launching in 2023, more than
OL,7,F125,000 people have been trained to
OL,8,Frespond to severe allergic reactions
OL,9,Fand the kit has been used to treat more
OL,10,Fthan 50 life-threatening allergic
OL,11,Freactions across the UK.
